    "comment": "Structure of the gallery section: nav tabs, medium pages, section pages, the artwork filter facets and the hub page's photographs. Edited by hand; consumed by build.mjs to render gallery*.html. Bilingual site copy lives here as literal UTF-8 because this is localized content, not code. heroSlides, aboutPanels and a medium page's optional cover each point at one photograph in content/artworks.json by artworkId plus imageIndex; the build refuses an in-situ view in any of those slots because the hub crops a photograph to fit its slot and an in-situ shot must keep the framing it was taken with. A medium page with no cover falls back to the first photograph of its first work; a medium page with no works renders mediumEmptyCover instead of promising an image.",
